  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xB89B" flags="0x0">
    <title>Stationary Limiter Readiness Threshold</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x8E2A; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. Calibrated inclusive readiness threshold for stationary rev-limiter accumulator ffff16a6. FUN 0004f324 sets readiness bit 4 of ffff247f when the accumulator is greater than or equal to this scalar and its secondary gate passes. The stock value is 381 accumulator counts. The threshold controls readiness for stationary fuel-cut/restore hysteresis 000085d9/000085da. Definition address projected from JK08A 0000911c through JK08A-JK78C.definition-addresses.csv: aligned readiness state machine preserves the threshold role.</description>
