    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x91EE; 1 rows x 1 columns; uint16; map confidence candidate. Fixed Base Fuel Schedule normalization reference shared by the internal Q7 load coordinate and engine-torque filling calculations. FUN 0003b75c writes ffff1048=min(255,floor(uint16[ffff1026]*128/scaler)); scheduler 00020dfe snapshots it to ffff102c. FUN 00065928 forms the Engine Torque Map coordinate min(65535,floor(uint16[ffff1024]*40960/scaler)), and FUN 00065c26 uses the same divisor in its torque base term. Stock scaler is 0x6a5a, or 27226. The exact arithmetic proves its common fixed-reference role and makes internal raw 128 equal Base Fuel Schedule divided by this reference at ratio 1. The HR A2L calls the calibration Cylinder Filling Up Efficiency Scaler and describes it as the BFS at maximum airflow. That physical name and the raw/2048 BFS conversion remain source-derived candidates. Editing this scalar shifts ignition, CVTC, candidate AFR, and torque coordinates together. Definition address projected from JK08A 00009534 through JK08A-JK78C.definition-addresses.csv: normalized homologous consumers preserve the primary limiter scalar role. Static diagnostic context: CID=1208H_B/FUEL SCHDL [code, nissan_family_candidate, via map evidence: indexed_by].</description>
