  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x4605" flags="0x0">
    <title>Timing-State Addend - Default/Post-Transition</title>
    <description>Exact JK78C. Address 0x137E0; 1 rows x 8 columns; uint8; map confidence candidate. Default/post-transition eight-point timing-state addend in FUN 0004afdc. It is selected whenever the stock-inert feature path and warm transition path are not selected and the separate state-3/bit-7 constant bypass is not active. The interpolated result enters ffff1511 through the exact x-128 transform. The separate constant path selects raw 0x9e, or +30 counts, when ffff22ff=3 and ffff2458.bit7=1. Target-vehicle A/B evidence isolates 00012196 during matched warm deceleration: a 16-count slot difference at 4000..4400 RPM produced the same 16-count median final-coordinate shift with no corresponding fuel-word shift. This proves one-for-one software-coordinate propagation and makes the catalog Cold Idle qualifier nonexclusive. A crank-referenced degree scale remains unverified. Index: implicit 1D-8 over ffff11b2 with nodes 0,32,...224 and saturation at element 7. Result disposition: writes (RAM ffff1511, site 0004b0d0). Definition address projected from JK08A 00012196 through JK08A-JK78C.definition-addresses.csv: homologous fallback branch preserves the default table role.</description>
